{"4608760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Garden Cleanup Simulator", "steam_appid": 4608760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Turn overgrown, messy gardens into clean and beautiful spaces. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Garden Cleanup Simulator is a relaxing simulation game where you cleanup gardens step by step. Clean and transform every corner while enjoying satisfying, visible progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4608760/extras/524f0fb29d3638038a9e77630c5784f8.avif?t=1787662749\" width=942 height=732 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">FROM CHAOS TO PERFECTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Start with overgrown grass, scattered trash, and lifeless plants. Every action brings you closer to a clean and peaceful garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4608760/extras/f8c104dac7a0036a84dfeea34e45680c.poster.avif?t=1787662749\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4608760/extras/f8c104dac7a0036a84dfeea34e45680c.webm?t=1787662749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4608760/extras/f8c104dac7a0036a84dfeea34e45680c.mp4?t=1787662749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">TAKE CARE OF GRASS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cut through thick, uncut grass and slowly bring the garden back under control. Watch the environment transform with every pass of the mower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4608760/extras/30abf6228a294660ed30e67eaf4b506c.poster.avif?t=1787662749\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4608760/extras/30abf6228a294660ed30e67eaf4b506c.webm?t=1787662749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4608760/extras/30abf6228a294660ed30e67eaf4b506c.mp4?t=1787662749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">REVIVE YOUR PLANTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dry and neglected plants need attention. Water them, bring them back to life, and restore the natural beauty of the garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4608760/extras/c7949b6ffa9dcba45aebab7a8a4199a6.poster.avif?t=1787662749\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4608760/extras/c7949b6ffa9dcba45aebab7a8a4199a6.webm?t=1787662749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4608760/extras/c7949b6ffa9dcba45aebab7a8a4199a6.mp4?t=1787662749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">RELAXING AND SATISFYING GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There is no rush. No stress. Just you, your tools, and the simple pleasure of turning chaos into order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4608760/extras/92ff0e87a35abbb62c4ccebd1d8fc9cc.avif?t=1787662749\" width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">SEE THE RESULTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enjoy the final transformation as messy, overgrown spaces turn into clean and beautiful gardens.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Turn overgrown, messy gardens into clean and beautiful spaces. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Garden Cleanup Simulator is a relaxing simulation game where you cleanup gardens step by step. Clean and transform every corner while enjoying satisfying, visible progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4608760/extras/524f0fb29d3638038a9e77630c5784f8.avif?t=1787662749\" width=942 height=732 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">FROM CHAOS TO PERFECTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Start with overgrown grass, scattered trash, and lifeless plants. Every action brings you closer to a clean and peaceful garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4608760/extras/f8c104dac7a0036a84dfeea34e45680c.poster.avif?t=1787662749\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4608760/extras/f8c104dac7a0036a84dfeea34e45680c.webm?t=1787662749\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4608760/extras/f8c104dac7a0036a84dfeea34e45680c.mp4?t=1787662749\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"